Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.86,0:00:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.16,0:00:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A smoker's cries.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.72,0:01:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,forgotten by a harsh\Nword, then let it be so.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Upon this world, I shall rain down tar\Nand ash, for I am the devil of nicotine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.74,0:01:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Cockroaches, this floor\Nis covered in trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.76,0:01:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How could someone even\Nlive in this filth? Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.94,0:01:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A rotten ball of rice that needs to soak.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.48,0:01:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't they know you have to wash\Nyour dishes after using them?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.98,0:01:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the kind of behavior\Nthat I can't stand. Son of hells!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.50,0:01:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that black goop supposed\Nto be soup at some point?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it just move right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.54,0:01:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! The answer bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.30,0:01:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I just stepped in something!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.30,0:01:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It was squishy and now\Nit's all over my foot!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.86,0:01:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.08,0:01:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.20,0:01:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.34,0:01:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting the fuck out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.04,0:02:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Nia
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.08,0:02:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna ask you this, but I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.84,0:03:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about moving on my hand,\Nbut it doesn't seem like my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.72,0:03:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, such a great\Nfavour. Come and say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.20,0:03:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't you say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.68,0:03:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't you say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.26,0:03:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.26,0:03:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.58,0:03:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If we experience the better end,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.26,0:03:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,we need to work without grief!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.26,0:03:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't have enough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,so we remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.08,0:03:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the tip about this\Ntemp agency yaku score when
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.58,0:03:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,one blows past one cigarette's\Nbudget one gets to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.66,0:03:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Number 82.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.66,0:04:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You got any work you've\Ncome to the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.86,0:04:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,When can you get started\Nlike yesterday and
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.58,0:04:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,find me something that\Nmakes a ton of dough?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.12,0:04:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, you're in luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.06,0:04:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got an opening for\Nsomething this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.18,0:04:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as it pays great, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.12,0:04:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a simple cleaning job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.84,0:04:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure anyone can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.74,0:04:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone, 15-minute break.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,15 minutes, everyone can come on up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.64,0:05:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.55,0:05:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You smell that shit you're covered in?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.32,0:05:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's flammable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.23,0:05:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's no smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.24,0:05:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I know baseball for dumb, but\Nyou understand that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.70,0:05:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I really can't stand this fucking job!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They work us like crazy, we don't get\Nbreaks, and on top of that, the pay sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.84,0:05:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, you agree with me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.88,0:05:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.24,0:05:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah, it sucks, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.70,0:05:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.61,0:05:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.78,0:05:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.06,0:05:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.97,0:05:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Autumn Darter's out already?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.02,0:05:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, fall's here, I guess. Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.06,0:05:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The older I get, the faster time flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.64,0:05:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.55,0:05:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Yaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:05:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You got back in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.68,0:06:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.32,0:06:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I expected you to take a proper vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.60,0:06:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My new part-time gig starts tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.46,0:06:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, this is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.04,0:06:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A tasty souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.66,0:06:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, look at you. That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.86,0:06:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Near my parents' house,\Nthere's a famous dorayaki shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.50,0:06:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just about to put the kettle on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.66,0:06:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Want a cup of tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.62,0:06:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.10,0:06:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But, uh, I'm a little tired from the\Ntravel, so I'll take a rain check.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.02,0:06:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.93,0:06:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting plenty of rest, then. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.78,0:06:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.69,0:06:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, was that Yaku just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.08,0:06:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure was.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.42,0:06:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I\Nhaven't seen her for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.16,0:06:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She went back home for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.92,0:06:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Anniversary of her granddad's passing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.14,0:06:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the black hair makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.28,0:06:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That black hair looks really cute on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.06,0:06:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if her grandfather\Nwas beast folk, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.62,0:06:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.04,0:07:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Little red dragonfly,\Nlittle red dragonfly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.08,0:07:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Da-ba-da-ba-ba, da-da-ba,\Nlittle red dragonfly,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.60,0:07:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cook you up a side dish for\Ntonight's dinner, little red dragonfly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nyah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.04,0:07:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out of smokes already!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.20,0:07:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.00,0:07:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.28,0:07:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you back in town yet, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.10,0:07:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Got any smokes I can have?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.36,0:07:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.52,0:07:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, kitty-kitty, I know you're in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.34,0:07:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I bum a cig or ten off ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.46,0:07:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.32,0:07:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta have one to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.04,0:07:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing in the dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.50,0:07:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not turn on a light?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.68,0:07:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,In my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.38,0:07:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.54,0:07:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go see your family sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.68,0:07:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You really should.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.90,0:08:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yani.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.46,0:08:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? Why? Why humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.26,0:08:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you're not a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.42,0:08:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So Yaniko how have things been going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.62,0:08:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, uh, I've been\Nworking here and there, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.74,0:08:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been fired a whole\Nbunch, though really now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.52,0:08:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah you'd be my fave\Nif you had a lighter of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.96,0:08:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,course okay then where\Ndid I put that lighter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.54,0:08:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.64,0:09:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll borrow a few of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.34,0:09:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I always found it tasted\Ndifferent when lit with a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.96,0:09:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.90,0:09:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you have a spare one for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.92,0:09:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.90,0:09:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're the best. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.00,0:09:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta get through these quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.30,0:09:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.10,0:09:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's this late already?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.70,0:09:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.14,0:09:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be home any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Mom, I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.60,0:09:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.62,0:09:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're smoking you\Nknow you can't do that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.34,0:09:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,here how many times do i have to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah And you just letting her do it mom
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.88,0:10:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't help she's like\Nthis because you never
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.98,0:10:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,yell at her I guess when\Nyou promised to quit
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.28,0:10:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,the other day that was\Nlie number one thousand
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.68,0:10:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That face won't work on me yeah\Ni don't even know what that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.08,0:10:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,face means Like two peas in a\Npod no matter how old they get
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.00,0:10:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One movie ticket for Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.12,0:10:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And one for Big Sis. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.68,0:10:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Movie theaters have assigned seats now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.92,0:10:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I love it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.64,0:10:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you reserve my seat so far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.46,0:10:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have cigarettes with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.88,0:10:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now you know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.44,0:10:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.90,0:10:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She likes to act strict,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.46,0:10:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but look at how Imoko's being\Nconsiderate so that you can smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.38,0:10:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Underneath it all you\Ncan really tell how much
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.72,0:10:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,she loves her big sis\Nwe don't need your input
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.48,0:10:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,mom the average human\Nlifespan is around 80 years
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.26,0:10:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy if I could\Nsurvive for half of that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.30,0:10:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Toshi, I'm begging you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.30,0:11:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be like me. I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.64,0:11:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,know if I've ever wanted\Nto smoke so bad you've
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.14,0:11:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,got your whole why does\Nthis The movie have to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.88,0:11:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,have so many damn scenes\Nwhere they're smoking!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.62,0:11:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're anything I've ever wanted to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.04,0:11:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.95,0:11:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna run to the restroom and...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.40,0:11:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.88,0:11:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, when things don't go\Nyour way, no matter how tough...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.38,0:11:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaniko, I just want one little puff!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.08,0:11:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Laugh it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.16,0:11:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I will, Yaniko, I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.14,0:11:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.48,0:11:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Devon, one last run!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.12,0:11:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go, Yaniko!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.06,0:11:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I love a good cry during a movie!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.66,0:11:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I really appreciate you\Nguys coming with me when
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.92,0:11:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,all of my friends found out\Nthis was a yakuza movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.08,0:11:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They had other things to do
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.64,0:11:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you two being weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.44,0:11:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Great now you've got mom smelling\Nlike a gross ashtray, too
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.54,0:11:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Know how to be considerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.62,0:11:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm not sure I like being\Nautomatically blamed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.72,0:11:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we're playing the victim game now Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.84,0:12:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,you don't understand\Nwhat I don't understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.42,0:12:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I wish moments like\Nthese could last forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.58,0:12:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's talk about\Nyour recent health checkup.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.52,0:12:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bit concerning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.96,0:12:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The nurse told me your convulsions\Nmade it difficult to draw blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.48,0:12:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,which tells me we're\Ndealing with alcoholism.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.16,0:12:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only are your AST\Nlevels highly elevated,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.16,0:12:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The score is the inverse\Nof your current GPA.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.04,0:12:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen such a\Ntextbook example of a slacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.14,0:12:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've heard all this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.56,0:12:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the drinking and get back in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If not, you won't see your\Ngraduation, but your funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.52,0:12:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your funeral. Your funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.44,0:12:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That was after quitting\Nfor a whole week already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.44,0:12:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.38,0:12:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.34,0:13:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Not watching where you're\Ngoing is a good way to get hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.18,0:13:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I should go easy on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.84,0:13:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She looks like she's in middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.54,0:13:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you trying to get home?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.34,0:13:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.44,0:13:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to walk you\Nhome if you need me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.44,0:13:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the same way to\Nget to Yanni's apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.14,0:13:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something bad happen today?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.46,0:13:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.62,0:13:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, a problem with school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.50,0:13:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.78,0:13:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's definitely not easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.14,0:13:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Back when I was around your age,\NI got bullied in school too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.20,0:13:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a lot, but I remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.30,0:13:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Boys would hide my things\Nlike my shoes and recorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.14,0:13:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They'd call me names like Cat Girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.80,0:13:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, during middle school graduation,\Nthe head bully confessed something to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.92,0:14:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He told me he did all that\Nstuff because he liked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.36,0:14:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.60,0:14:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I went through all that pain\Njust because he had a crush.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.02,0:14:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's when I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a way bigger deal\Nin my head than a real.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.32,0:14:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That story sounds more like a humble brag.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.74,0:14:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I didn't mean it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.40,0:14:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I see how you'd think that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.92,0:14:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't intentional.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I just.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.58,0:14:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.80,0:14:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I do feel a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.92,0:14:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My problems aren't as\Nbad as I think they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.42,0:14:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm being dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.72,0:14:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.22,0:14:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.22,0:14:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What a strange little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.64,0:14:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,She kind of reminds me of Yani in a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.70,0:14:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, an earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.72,0:14:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's a whole lot of trembling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.94,0:15:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.92,0:15:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing is longer than the\Ncredits at the end of a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.12,0:15:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Aruko, we best\Ncadattled just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.86,0:15:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.77,0:15:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're causing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.02,0:15:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just that I've got a follow-up\Nappointment coming up from my...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.74,0:15:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, doll, I'm not your mama, but a\Nlittle moderation wouldn't hurt you none.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.66,0:15:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How long since you had a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.30,0:15:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A day? That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.06,0:15:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only been an hour. Come on, Aruko.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.84,0:15:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.94,0:15:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.68,0:15:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Outside of my apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.46,0:15:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Quake?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.37,0:15:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a biggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.29,0:15:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule number one, don't stay indoors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.48,0:15:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't get it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.56,0:15:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone into spasm mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.00,0:15:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Desperate times!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.06,0:15:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Desperate measures!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.24,0:15:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn door is stuck and it won't open!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.72,0:16:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means I'm fucking screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.54,0:16:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Those girls cannot see me like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.72,0:16:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's rule number two!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.96,0:16:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go to the balcony door,\Nround back, and break the glass!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.86,0:16:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.06,0:16:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If I've got to choose between\Nembarrassment and broken glass, no contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.86,0:16:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunkin! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.68,0:16:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, oh, uh, good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.40,0:16:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, is that a centaur costume? How fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.36,0:16:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.60,0:16:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, centaurs don't\Nhave two heads, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.60,0:16:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is this like a Cerberus\Nvariant or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.46,0:16:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kill me. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.50,0:16:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I could talk\Nmy way out of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So today I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.52,0:16:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, now let's\Njust calm down a sec here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.78,0:17:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay then, this is just at the top\Nof my head, but I'm thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.76,0:17:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You were in the middle of banging your\Nbespoke sex doll when the earthquake hit,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.02,0:17:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but the doll was in vaginal spasm mode\Nand locked you and your you-know-what in,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.52,0:17:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,so you ran for safety, but you got\Nlocked out, and now you're stuck outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.20,0:17:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna guess by the\Namount of sweat I'm seeing...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.00,0:17:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullseye!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.91,0:17:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Monk Art is for the win!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.52,0:17:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, just hang out in my place\Nuntil the handyman gets here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.06,0:17:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let me go buy you some underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.92,0:17:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be apologizing for\Nthe rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.24,0:17:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to walk that close to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.26,0:17:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.64,0:17:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, that was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yanni Neko's movements can be hard to\Nread, so I just had to take her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.00,0:17:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.64,0:17:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,When did I lay down to take a nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.44,0:17:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in my whack-ass dream. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.36,0:18:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you had turned into a censor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.16,0:18:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What the fuck are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.24,0:18:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So you wrote something new\Nyou want me to look at?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.96,0:18:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.87,0:18:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well actually He was\Na friend who wrote it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.26,0:18:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't posted any of\Nmy writing on Kakeyome.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.30,0:18:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Based on what you said last time, I\Ndecided to use a popular plot cliche.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.20,0:18:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,that's all over the site.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.42,0:18:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, that's what my friend decided\Nto do when she heard your advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.50,0:18:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So you wrote a banishment story?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.48,0:18:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.74,0:18:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And it was surprisingly fun, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.58,0:18:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I realized following a\Nplot cliche isn't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.08,0:18:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, that's what my friend said.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.32,0:18:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There once was a man\Nwho was a dragon major.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.22,0:18:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The man had no name.\NFor he had abandoned it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.18,0:18:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,nor did he need it as the\Npeople simply called him Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.42,0:18:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A Dragon Major is one of the many vocations\Npracticed by the peoples of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.24,0:18:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a big fan of\Nexposition, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.02,0:18:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with this kind of lore so\Nimportant for the world building?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.36,0:19:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.60,0:19:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,About time you got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember you said you wanted\Nto talk about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.92,0:19:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, kid, I'll be straight with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.98,0:19:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You are no longer a\Nmember of our party. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.50,0:19:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get off of my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.14,0:19:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, this major dude is supposed\Nto be the main character, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.06,0:19:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, that's not bad, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.02,0:19:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.00,0:19:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the main character\Nthe one doing the banishing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.88,0:19:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it backwards, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.40,0:19:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.88,0:19:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I... What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.42,0:19:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I... Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.26,0:19:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I know that's not\Nwhat the plot usually goes,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.36,0:19:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but I didn't want to write the same\Nthing as everyone else on the Black Wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.98,0:19:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought if I had the\Nmajor do the banishing,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.94,0:19:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,then the readers would start\Nto question the cliche?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.40,0:19:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and then there would be even\Nmore value added to the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.44,0:19:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,any of the cliché stories\Non here, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.20,0:19:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.30,0:19:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you ended up here,\Nbut I get that you're in a bind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.06,0:19:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The typhoon blew your tent away,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.64,0:20:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm sure that makes it\Ntough to live by the river, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have family at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.80,0:20:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone you can reach out to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.26,0:20:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood ties are nothing\Nmore than a concept,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.32,0:20:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,a way to enforce standards of\Nrelationships. Come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.82,0:20:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.54,0:20:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.86,0:20:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You can relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.00,0:20:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not asking you to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.14,0:20:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like you and I are strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.28,0:20:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You could even say\Nwe're a family of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.92,0:20:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel that way about everyone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.18,0:20:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,F-family?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.48,0:20:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Having said that, you can open up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.16,0:20:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.56,0:20:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I can find a little corner\Nthat I can rent to you super cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.02,0:20:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I would really appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.46,0:20:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm glad we worked that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.10,0:20:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we grab a treat?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.62,0:20:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be my treat. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.90,0:20:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, there's that wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.12,0:20:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin! Iora!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.24,0:20:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.02,0:21:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, sorry about that. Boner!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.74,0:21:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, look, it's a natural\Nphysiological response for a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.06,0:21:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't control it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.08,0:21:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear! Boner! I can't help it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.40,0:21:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, we're a family, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.94,0:21:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in this together!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.18,0:21:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Family?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.28,0:21:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Boner!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.19,0:21:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Family members shouldn't\Ngive you a raging boner!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.46,0:21:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So, whatever comes off,\Ncomes off, right? You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.76,0:21:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Counting on ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.72,0:21:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, alright, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.96,0:21:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, wow, I barely brushed\Nit and look at all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.06,0:21:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it is shedding season, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.20,0:21:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at how much fur I've brushed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.58,0:21:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like clockwork.\NEvery spring and fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.42,0:21:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe how much is coming off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.30,0:21:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I could make another\NYani Neko out of all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.28,0:21:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really enjoying this, this is so fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.64,0:22:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.32,0:22:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.60,0:22:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.88,0:22:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.98,0:22:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.20,0:23:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We had to relate or work too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.22,0:23:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And are BEC.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.66,0:23:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of people in the street?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.28,0:23:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, I know. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.02,0:23:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.38,0:23:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.54,0:23:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.18,0:23:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There are siren.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.67,0:23:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.56,0:24:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.66,0:24:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
